  "安装变体需要完整、有序的 a01–a26 原始步骤": "The assembly variant requires the complete original a01–a26 steps in order.",
  "安装动画只表达认件与先后层次；位移、孔位及间隙为示意，不验证真实装配路线、齿轮相位、弹簧预紧、片距或检查合格。": "The assembly animation only identifies parts and shows their order and layers. Movement, hole positions and clearances are illustrative; they do not verify actual assembly paths, gear timing, spring preload, frame spacing or successful checks.",
  "先把对应版本外壳装到支架；螺钉尚未装回": "First fit the appropriate shell version to the support; the screws are not yet refitted",
  "装回 3 枚 823013 与 2 枚 823017，逐枚显示便于清点": "Refit 3 screws 823013 and 2 screws 823017, shown individually for counting",
  "固定件就位后贴回螺钉处饰皮；粘接效果未模拟": "Replace the covering over the screws after fitting the fasteners; bonding is not simulated",
  "采用 1996 改型的五枚固定件；逐颗播放排序是教学清点顺序，不是原厂规定的拧紧次序或扭矩。": "Uses the five fasteners of the modified 1996 version. Their one-by-one display order supports teaching and counting; it is not a factory tightening sequence or torque specification.",
  "辨认并放回曝光联锁片": "Identify and refit the exposure lock",
  "放回联锁线簧，按原图核对挂接": "Refit the interlock wire spring and check its attachment against the original drawing",
  "放回两片簧片；弯折与接触关系仍须实物核对": "Refit the two spring leaves; bends and contact relationships still require physical checking",
  "同一句内的逐件显示用于辨认，不增加原手册没有规定的施工要求。": "Parts mentioned together are displayed individually for identification; this does not add work requirements absent from the original manual.",
  "核对按钮与垫圈：本拆卸路线未取出它们，不重复假造拆装": "Check the button and washer: this disassembly route left them in place, so no fictitious removal and refitting is repeated",
  "在机外示意弹簧与锁止臂配合；按手册涂脂": "Show the spring and locking-arm relationship outside the magazine; grease as instructed",
  "将锁止臂组件接到按钮；挂钩细节未作物理求解": "Attach the locking-arm assembly to the button; hook engagement is not physically simulated",
  "按钮和垫圈原来留在模型中。本步仅核对其套装关系；挂接与涂脂以 PDF 7 原图和实物为准。": "The button and washer remained in the model. This step only checks their fitted relationship; use the original drawing on PDF 7 and the physical parts for attachment and greasing.",
  "先放回锁止簧": "Refit the locking spring first",
  "辨认薄片与密封件；将密封件放入薄片内": "Identify the foil and seal; place the seal inside the foil",
  "两件作为配合组件装到支架上": "Fit both parts to the support as a paired assembly",
  "这里只示意包合次序，不模拟薄片折弯、密封压缩或替用材料尺寸。": "Only the enclosure sequence is illustrated. Foil bending, seal compression and substitute-material dimensions are not simulated.",
  "先用插刀把遮光组件保持在位": "First hold the light-trap assembly in place with the dark slide",
  "装上前接合外板，保持密封件的位置": "Fit the front connecting plate while retaining the seal’s position",
  "再装外板的九枚螺钉；不表达规定扭矩": "Then fit the nine plate screws; no specified torque is represented",
  "检查提示：实体插拔插刀并核验联锁；模型保持静止，未实机检查": "Check reminder: insert and withdraw the actual dark slide and verify the interlock; the model remains still and no physical check has been performed",
  "量规校准提示：按原图测量；屏幕尺寸不能测出 3.55 mm ± 0.05 mm，当前未验证": "Gauge-calibration reminder: measure as shown in the original drawing. Screen dimensions cannot measure 3.55 mm ± 0.05 mm; this is currently unverified",
  "先对照图 4 的实心圆点涂脂；不把高亮面当作涂脂范围": "First grease the solid-dot locations in Fig. 4; a highlighted surface is not a greasing area",
  "再放入所选型号的释放臂及随件弹簧": "Then fit the selected model’s release arm and associated spring",
  "中央机构齿轮与轴少量点油；先读 PDF 8 原文": "Apply a small amount of oil to the center-mechanism gears and shafts; first read the original text on PDF 8",
  "先套到定位销上；本步停在略抬起位置，下一步才最终落位": "Place it on the locating pin first; this step leaves it slightly raised, with final seating in the next step",
  "离体点油在此用文字与原图说明，不显示油滴或虚构可见涂油范围。终点约 6 个模型单位的抬起量仅用于表达“尚未最终落位”。": "Oiling before installation is explained by text and the original drawing; no oil drops or invented visible application area are shown. The final raised position of about 6 model units only means that the part is not yet fully seated.",
  "延续上一步中央机构略抬起的状态，先装间距齿轮": "Keep the center mechanism slightly raised from the previous step and fit the spacing gear first",
  "间距轮就位后，再把中央机构放入支架轴毂": "After seating the spacing gear, lower the center mechanism into the support bushing",
  "先把回零弹簧装入间距齿轮；只显示装配层次": "First fit the return-to-zero spring into the spacing gear; only assembly layers are shown",
  "预紧与回零核验：读本步原文和图 4、5；动画不转动齿轮或弹簧": "Preload and zero-return check: read this step’s original text and Figs. 4 and 5; the animation does not rotate the gear or spring",
  "约 1½ 圈及观察方向只按原手册执行。动画无弹性求解，不验证预紧或回零。": "Use the original manual for the approximately 1½ turns and viewing direction. The animation has no elastic simulation and does not verify preload or return to zero.",
  "先放入摆臂及随件弹簧": "First fit the lever and its associated spring",
  "轴涂脂后穿入；实际轴向配合以原图为准": "Grease the shaft before inserting it; use the original drawing for the actual axial fit",
  "接回两根拉簧到原图 A 标记销；形变未模拟": "Reconnect the two tension springs to pin A in the original drawing; deformation is not simulated",
  "只核对中央机构两根弹簧的挂接；它们已经随机构在位，不再次移入": "Only check attachment of the two center-mechanism springs; they are already in place with the mechanism and are not moved in again",
  "原文没有分别列出两根弹簧编号；不另造第二个零件或拉伸轨道。": "The original text does not list separate numbers for the two springs. No second part or stretching track is invented.",
